id: DRAFT-mailx-8.1.2_git20220412-compiler-executables-fallback-path-error127
trigger_tool: make|conan
phase: building
error_signature: make: .*No such file or directory|make.*Error 127
severity: 3
category: build-system, ohos, compat
match_keywords: compiler_executables, error 127, hmbs_repair_method, clang, PATH
title: tools.build:compiler_executables绝对路径缺失时回退PATH解决raw Makefile真机Error127
root_cause: ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64把tools.build:compiler_executables硬编码为CI worker布局/data/service/hnp/bin/clang，真机该路径不存在；配方把conf值原样传给make CC导致Error 127
affected_scope: 直接读取tools.build:compiler_executables并原样传给make CC的raw Makefile类C/C++库配方
verification_cmd: 真机conan create通过且make不再报No such file or directory/Error 127；路径存在时保持CI语义原样使用
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: compiler-executables-isfile-fallback-path
rec_description: 对tools.build:compiler_executables取值做os.path.isfile校验，缺失时用shutil.which回退到PATH的clang/cc并打warning+info日志，存在时原样使用
rec_command: conanfile.py: 新增import shutil；build()改用or {} + compilers.get取值+isfile校验+which回退后传make CC=
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: conan-recipe
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: path-literal-fallback-with-audit-log
fallback_description: 若which亦找不到则直接用clang/cc字面量依赖PATH解析，保留失败日志审计不硬编码CI绝对路径
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: CC=/data/service/hnp/bin/clang|compiler_executables.*CC=
forbid_1_reason: 禁止不做存在性校验直接透传CI绝对路径给make CC
forbid_1_consequence: 真机build()报No such file or directory并make Error 127，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: [DRAFT-9639-minibwa-compiler-executables-fallback]
